msgctxt "84_Savvy Citizen"
msgid "Sometimes, they hand out special editions of Tokyo Sports around here."
msgstr "A veces reparten ediciones especiales de Tokyo Sports por aquí."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Savvy Citizen
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "96_Savvy Citizen"
msgid "Of course, they don't hand them out unless something big happens, but if you manage to get one, it feels like you were there for a historic moment."
msgstr "Por supuesto que no los reparten a no ser que ocurra algo grande, pero si consigues uno, se siente tan genial. ¡Es como si hubieses asistido a un momento histórico!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=2
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P2
#. y4:msg_speaker=Special Editions of Magazines
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "108_Savvy Citizen"
msgid "When something remarkable happens, special editions of magazines are distributed in Theater Square. There's no telling when they'll be handed out, so keep checking Theater Square."
msgstr "Cuando ocurre algo extraordinario, se reparten ediciones especiales de revistas en la plaza del teatro. Si quieres conseguirlas todas, será mejor que estés atentol lugar, ya que no se sabe cuándo se distribuirán."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Keiner
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "120_Savvy Citizen"
msgid "This information has been added as a <Color:14>memo<Color:Default>.\\r\nRead <Color:14>memos<Color:Default> by selecting <Color:14>Memos<Color:Default> in the Pause Menu.\\r\nYou can access the Pause Menu with the <Action:Button_Options@Adventure> button."
msgstr "Esta información ha sido añadida como una <Color:14>nota<Color:Default>.\nLee las <Color:14>notas<Color:Default> seleccionando <Color:14>Notas<Color:Default> en el menú de pausa.\nPuedes acceder al menú de pausa con el botón <Action:Button_Options@Adventure>."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Keiner
msgctxt "132_Savvy Citizen"
msgid "That's why I can never stop circling Kamurocho－I've got to have them all!"
msgstr "Por eso nunca puedo dejar de dar vueltas por Kamurocho, ¡quiero tenerlas todas!"
